{"id":"8ce4101309cb3ce8","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-mip-equals-nexp.md","title":"thm-mip-equals-nexp (MIP = NEXP)","display":"thm-mip-equals-nexp (MIP = NEXP)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-mip]]","[[28-df-nexp]]"],"display":"thm-mip-equals-nexp (MIP = NEXP)","label":"28-thm-mip-equals-nexp","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-mip-equals-nexp","MIP = NEXP","Multi-prover interactive proofs equal NEXP"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 8.23","source_printed_pages":"163","source_pdf_pages":"189","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3458f62defc55ad\" href=\"?note=f3458f62defc55ad\" title=\"28-df-mip\">28-df-mip</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75ba006af50075ad\" href=\"?note=75ba006af50075ad\" title=\"28-df-nexp\">28-df-nexp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mip-equals-nexp (MIP = NEXP)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-mip-equals-nexp"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-mip-equals-nexp</span><span>MIP = NEXP</span><span>Multi-prover interactive proofs equal NEXP</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 8.23"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"163"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"189"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{MIP}\">\\(\\mathbf{MIP}\\)</span> uses finitely many noncommunicating classical provers and a polynomial-time verifier</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NEXP}=\\bigcup_{a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)^a})\">\\(\\mathbf{NEXP}=\\bigcup_{a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)^a})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{MIP}=\\mathbf{NEXP}\n=\\bigcup_{a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)^a}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{MIP}=\\mathbf{NEXP}\n=\\bigcup_{a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)^a}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书此处给定理陈述及多证明者直观，未提供完整证明；以下仅为证明思路，不能作为完整本地证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{MIP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NEXP}\">\\(\\mathbf{MIP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NEXP}\\)</span>, an exponential-time nondeterministic machine guesses complete prover strategy tables and exactly evaluates the verifier over its polynomial random tape.</p>\n<p>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NEXP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{MIP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NEXP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{MIP}\\)</span>, arithmetization together with low-degree and multilinearity consistency tests lets a polynomial-time verifier cross-check spatially separated answers from noncommunicating provers with a constant completeness–soundness gap.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Theorem 8.23，印刷页 163；PDF 页 189。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：书中仅列陈述，NEXP到MIP完整证明未给出。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-mip","status":"resolved","id":"f3458f62defc55ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-mip]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nexp","status":"resolved","id":"75ba006af50075ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nexp]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{MIP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NEXP}=\\bigcup_{a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)^a})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{MIP}=\\mathbf{NEXP}\n=\\bigcup_{a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)^a}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{MIP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NEXP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NEXP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{MIP}","display":false}],"bytes":1891,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"协议刻画：[[28-thm-public-coin-ip]]、[[28-thm-ip-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-mip-equals-nexp]]。"}],"outgoing":["f3458f62defc55ad","75ba006af50075ad"]}